            "review_text": "eileent3821\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia2474 contributions\n0\nABYSMAL SERVICE\nApr 2024 • Solo\nWas standing outside waiting to be seated even though it was after the lunch peak hours. Sad to say none of the staff even bothered when they saw me standing at the wait to be seated sign hence I walked in and sat down at a table. Again the staff saw me and yet did not offer me a menu until I asked for it. Ordered the basil pork and a fresh coconut. It took a long time for the food to arrive and even worse the coconut. I was literally half way through my rice which was undercooked and had to keep asking for my drink which I could see was on the counter and yet no staff was taking it to me. Informed the staff of the rice and she just shrugged her shoulders and walked away. Went to the cashier counter repeated the same thing and got no response as well. Highly NOT RECOMMENDED. Go to the one in TAKA instead\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 6, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
